      "note": "False positive: Bounty#issue_url is a server-constructed URL, 'https://github.com/#{repository.full_name}/issues/#{github_issue_number}'. full_name is GitHub-sourced (owner/repo, format-constrained) and github_issue_number is an integer column, so the href is always a well-formed https://github.com URL and can never be a javascript: scheme. Triaged in AUDIT.md (Part 2)."
